{"id":"sortie","lemma":"sortie","pos":"noun","rank":609,"glosses":["exit; way out","act of exiting","end; final part of"],"ipa":"/sɔʁ.ti/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/10/Fr-sortie.ogg/Fr-sortie.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"sorties"},"formAudio":{"sorties":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/86/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-sorties.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"La sortie sera sur la gauche.","en":"The exit will be on the left.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"left"}]},{"text":"Où est la sortie ?","en":"Where's the exit?","words":[{"g":"where"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Comment êtes-vous sorties de votre chambre ?","en":"How did you get out of your room?","words":[{"g":"how"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"your, belonging to you"},{"g":"a room."}]},{"text":"Cette porte est la seule sortie.","en":"This door is the only exit.","words":[{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},{"g":"door"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"alone","l":"seul"},null]},{"text":"Elles s'en sont bien sorties.","en":"They handled it well.","words":[{"g":"they"},{"g":"oneself / if"},{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"well"},null]}]}